]--><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\"> </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><br></strong></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong>1. </strong></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><strong><strong>사업명</strong></strong> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: 2021</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년도 산학연 Collabo R&amp;D사업(예비연구단계)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><strong><strong>지원기관</strong></strong> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">중소벤처기업부</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3. <strong><strong>지원기준</strong></strong></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1) <strong><strong>예비연구(1단계) 지원기준</strong></strong></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- 정부지원연구개발비 : 연구개발비의 80%이내, 최대 8개월, 5천만원 이내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">- 기관부담연구개발비 : 연구개발비의 20%이상, 기관부담연구개발비(현금+현물) 중 10%이상은 현금으로 부담</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">2) <strong><strong>사업화 R&amp;D(2단계)지원기준</strong></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- 정부지원연구개발비 : 연구개발비의 80%이내, 최대 2년 간&nbsp; 2 ∼ 4억원 이내 지원(연간 지원한도 2억원 이내)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- 기관부담연구개발비 : 연구개발비의 20%이상, 연차별 납부, 기관부담연구개발비(현금+현물) 중 10%이상은 현금으로 부담</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; * 2단계 사업화 R&amp;D는 '20년 예비연구(1단계) 수행 과제만 신청 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">4.<strong><strong> 지원대상</strong></strong></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><strong>- <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>주관연구개발기관 : 기업부설연구소 또는 연구개발전담부서를 보유하고 있거나 설립계획이 있는 중소기업기본법 제2의 규정에 의한 중소기업</strong></span></strong></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">(2단계 신청기간까지 기업부설연구소 또는 연구개발전담부서를 설치하고 한국산업기술진흥협회에서 발급하는 기업부설연구소 또는 연구개발전담부서 인정서 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제출필요)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">* <strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">주관연구개발기관(중소기업)과 공동연구개발기관(대학)</span> 공동책임자 간은 국가연구개발사업 수행 이력이 없어야 함</span></strong></strong></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">(단, 공동연구개발기관의 공동책임자가 아닌 참여연구원으로 참여한 이력은 제외)&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">&nbsp; </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;*&nbsp; 중소기업기술개발사업 종합관리시스템(&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.smtech.go.kr/\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">www.smtech.go.kr</span></a><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">) 회원가입(기업), 과제에 참여하는 양 기관의 연구원 필히 회원가입</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif;\">&nb